<p>Weave darkness (power <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 23, 33, 42, 50</acronym>) in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 5,</acronym> blocking all light but the most powerful and teleporting you a short range.</p>